			</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v15002036" />
			<v n="36">
				This is 
				
				 the number of the priests: the sons of Jedaiah (through the family of Jeshua), 973;
			</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v15002037" />
			<v n="37">
